WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.480
Well, class,

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:05.730
a new student will be transferring
into the E Class today.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.020
Is it a girl? Is it?!

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.320
I got a photo from Commander Karasuma--

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:11.740
she's pretty cute!

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.200
Oho! <i>Super</i> cute!

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.820
And check out her boobs!

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:17.830
Nothing like a girl with something on top!

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:22.580
"No More Big Boobs"

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.700
You boys are nasty!

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.120
Yeah, that's right!

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.580
<i>That's</i> your complaint?

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:27.460
Eh?

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.590
What's with the rock?

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:33.010
I am the Autonomous
Intelligence Magic Stone Tablet

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:33.800
who will be joining your class.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:34.930
It <i>talks</i>!

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:51.070
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:00.490
"Nagisa"

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:02.160
"Karma"

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:03.160
"Kaede"

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:04.500
"Isogai" "Maehara"

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.170
"Rio" "Okuda" "Sugino" "Kanzaki"

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:08.670
"Chiba" "Hayami"

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.170
"Hinata" "Meg"

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:12.670
"Hinano" "Takebayashi" "Toka" "Justice"

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:14.670
"Muramatsu" "Kirara" "Yoshida" "Terasaka"

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:16.680
"Okajima" "Hara" "Mimura" "Fuwa" "Sugaya"

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:18.680
"Karasuma" "Irina"

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:34.990
"The Evolved Mage"

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:38.030
Why is the transfer student a stone tablet?

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:42.990
The Sage's Tablet, where sages
of old recorded all of their magic

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:44.540
in order to kill the Big Bad.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:47.960
On her is written all of the spells
used throughout history.

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:49.460
All of the spells?

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:51.000
Like spells to make your boobs bigger?

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.960
And spells that stop time
so you can do whatever you want?!

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.170
No such thing!

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:58.380
To prevent people like <i>that</i>
from using her for evil,

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:01.800
the sages gave the tablet
the capacity for thought.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.260
--So we're bad guys now?
--So we're bad guys now?

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:07.350
This has allowed me to be able
to use magic of my own will.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:10.730
I will use this magic
solely to kill the Big Bad.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:11.810
Yeah, but...

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:15.400
You can't beat our teacher
with regular old spells.

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.190
Never fear.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.070
By combining two spells,

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:24.740
I have the power to unleash magic
the world has never seen.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:33.670
This...

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.090
...is my bug.

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.800
Where do we even <i>start</i> with this?!

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:39.220
What's with those hands?
Is there a <i>person</i> in there?!

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.040
Magic.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:42.760
It looks incredibly realistic...

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:43.430
Magic.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:44.970
And what about the rice bowls?!

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:45.810
Magic.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:49.100
My magic consumes a great deal of HP,

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.230
and I must use items to replenish it.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.770
More, please.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.650
--There <i>isn't</i> any more!
--Her magic works on him.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:55.940
"Koro Sensei fixed up the classroom"

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.230
--Yes, there is. Right there.
--She's an E Class student as of today.

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:58.070
--But this is...
--<i>More</i>.
--She's an E Class student as of today.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:59.150
No objections?

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:00.740
Marvelous!

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:04.530
Welcome to the E Class,
Autonomous Intelligence Magic Stone Tablet!

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:07.370
By the way, can I ask you something?

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:13.500
"Super Paradise" "Sexy Underwear"

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:10.080
Is there a spell that'll remove
this mosaic censoring?

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:13.500
It is forbidden to instruct
the Big Bad in the ways of magic...

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:14.750
...but yes.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.460
There<i> is</i>?!

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.460
"Super Paradise" "Sexy Underwear"

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:20.260
A sage spent his whole life
creating the spell to do so.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:21.430
How admirable...!

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:24.050
Anyone who'd spend his life
on <i>that</i> is no sage!

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:25.530
Koro-Q.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.060
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:29.850
Now: your first quest
with a new party member.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:34.770
"Gungagun Cave"

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:33.100
Try to level up as you
make your attempts on my life!

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.360
Yes, sir!

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.650
Hey, why don't we pick a name for you?

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:40.690
"Autonomous Intelligence
Magic Stone Tablet" is a mouthful.

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:45.780
After repelling approaching thieves
while sealed away in a cave to the north,

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:50.120
they shortened my name to "Ritsu,"
as in "Ritsu, the Evolved Mage."

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:52.120
I think we've heard that before!

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:56.590
So you were one of the three
mighty warriors in the rumors--like Karma!

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:59.170
For more info,
take another look at "The Red Devil"!

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:00.340
Uh, Fuwa?

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:03.050
Then we'll call you Ritsu, too.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:04.550
Huh?

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:05.970
Did we make her mad?

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.640
You can <i>walk</i>, too?!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.140
What's with those feet?

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.920
Hey, gang: enemies!

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:13.060
"Some Lv. 5 Stone Kunudon draw near!"

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.770
Analysis complete. These are statue monsters.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.820
Their attacks are subtly heavy.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.030
Subtly?

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:26.700
I text this girl I like "good morning"
and "good night" every day,

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.950
but she never replies.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.370
That's subtly heavy, all right.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:32.910
Emotional warfare.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.870
I will take care of them.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.250
Combo spell:

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.840
Flame Rain!

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.090
Fantastic!

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:45.720
Thank you, Ritsu!

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:46.590
Huh?

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:49.430
Petrify.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:50.470
Huh?

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.350
What's going on?!

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.230
Our bodies are turning to stone!

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.890
I alone defeated them,

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:58.190
so I am entitled to all 
the experience points.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:01.030
Incapacitated party members
do not receive experience,

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.990
so I will petrify you for a moment.

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:04.360
You've got to be kidding!

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:07.070
"The E Class was petrified!"

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:10.830
"Ritsu's level increases!"

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:10.830
Hey, Ritsu, wasn't that a little much?

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:13.660
I have determined that, 
to defeat the Big Bad,

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:15.910
it is more efficient to focus on my level

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:18.740
rather than for everyone
to level up a little at a time.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:21.250
Do you really mean that?

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.210
Let us continue.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.340
Koro-Q!

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:26.880
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.510
Ow...

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:31.350
Hey, Ritsu, can I ask for some healing magic?

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.890
Comparing the number
of monsters my magic can defeat

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.310
and the number you can defeat once healed,

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.650
then adding up the experience points in play,

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.360
it would not be reasonable to heal you.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.520
Shut down theoretically!

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:49.660
Ritsu kept on hogging all the
powerful items and equipment we got.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:53.830
Ritsu...

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:58.040
You've got to come up with
a good way to get along with everyone.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.080
Get along?

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.250
There is no need.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.130
I will defeat you by myself.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.590
My combo magic isn't hitting him?

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:08.300
Has he already adapted to it?

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.920
Oh, what lovely fingers you have, miss!

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.850
It is absurd to be
tending to spell-casting fingers!

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.980
There's something I'd like you to see.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:18.810
Hmm?

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.270
"A Lv. 19 Stone Kunudon draws near!"

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:23.980
Lemme tell ya...

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:27.740
M'wife left me <i>and</i> I lost m'job to boot!

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:30.110
I got chronic illnesses an' no insurance!

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:32.240
Do ya even know how hard that is?!

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.240
That's Level 19, all right.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:35.700
Definitely heavier.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:43.540
I'mma teach you brats how 
hard life really is...

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:49.470
Do you think they can beat him?

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:53.850
It is reckless. They are no match
for that monster now.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.810
I will fight him.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:57.310
Oh, class!

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:00.520
Time for that you-know-what
you were working on secretly after class!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.520
--Busted!
--Busted!

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:04.860
Once your target knows about it,
there's no point hiding it.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.030
Ugh!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.360
C'mon, Nagisa!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.700
Flames, dwell within this blade!

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.200
Fire Sword!

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:13.320
--Offense-buffing light!
--Offense-buffing light!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:15.280
--Mighty Aura!
--Mighty Aura!

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:16.870
--Here goes!
--Yeah!

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.710
--Fiery...
--Fiery...

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:21.170
--...Cross Slash!
--...Cross Slash!

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.880
We did it!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:31.800
"The Stone Kunudon was defeated!"

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:31.010
---Dad!
--Daddy!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.680
--Huh?
--How are we supposed to go on living?!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.640
--How are we supposed to go on living?!

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.470
Those are all your kids?!

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:37.930
Heavy.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.140
Don't cry.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.890
When are you gonna change back?

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.290
Don't you think the odds
of defeating me increase significantly

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:49.110
if you work together?

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.700
That may be the case.

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:56.200
Then let's have some afterschool work
to teach you how to cooperate!

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.540
Careful on your way back, class!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:59.910
Later!

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.250
"The next day"

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.960
Good morning, everybody!

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.720
Wha-a-at?!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:15.220
It's another day for
working together and doing our best!

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:16.180
Who <i>are</i> you?

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:18.140
Ritsu, of course!

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:22.600
I'm going to work very hard
so you'll all come to like me!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:26.560
Fine by me. Nothing beats a 2D woman.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:29.940
Takebayashi... <i>That's</i> your first line?

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.860
Overnight? But how?

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.150
Behind the tablet

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:37.070
was an olden tongue
controlling her mental make-up.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:40.660
I deciphered that and massaged it a bit.

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:42.830
You can read and write ancient languages?

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:45.420
This teacher can do anything.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:48.420
The best heroes are well-informed
about a great many things.

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:51.460
Don't <i>you</i> neglect
your ancient-language studies, now!

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.920
Yes, sir!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:57.090
So, Ritsu, could you teach me that
mosaic-removal method, by any chance?

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:58.930
Don't use her for evil!

00:09:52.820 --> 00:10:00.570
"Next Time: The Silver Berserker"
